// The fight's screens (ADR-0047): its buttons, labels, popups and hints, the piles and the Program's panel, and the
// sentences the log window folds a volley into (LogDigest), keyed by the English exactly as the code shows it (%s a
// name or word, %d a whole number). When the Japanese needs the values in another order, number them: {1} is the
// first %s or %d of the English, {2} the second.
[
  {"en": "End turn  [E]", "to": "ターン終了  [E]"},
